/**

@page WFS_PLUGIN_INTRO Introduction

The purpose of WFS module is to provide WFS access to observations, predictions and other data.

Following WFS requests are available:
- @b GetCapabilities
- @b ListStoredQueries
- @b DescribeStoredQueries
- @b DescribeFeatureType
- @b GetFeature (stored queries, and ad hoc queries whose feature type names are mapped to stored
  queries with the plugin configuration entry @b typename-storedquery-mapping)
- @b GetPropertyValue (as GetFeature)

*/
